From 51cff7682b3b6bfbe0ebfb06ea1ab3c917a295d1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: kudanilmakantahwu <kudanilmakantahwu@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 14:18:06 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] freedreno/a5xx: fix 2D blit uploads and program highest bank
 bit

Backport against Mesa 26.2.6. The first three upstream commits fix the
a512/FD512 2D blit path (MR !45483): CP_BLIT(BLIT_OP_COPY) silently
performs no memory write, which breaks glTexSubImage2D uploads into a
texture that is still referenced by an unflushed batch.

  ba27232 freedreno/registers: make the 2D blit ifmt enums common
  a5c42c0 freedreno/a5xx: convert 2D blits through the right intermediate format
  c0235ef freedreno/a5xx: program the 2D source and use BLIT_OP_SCALE

The hbb changes are a separate fix, included because the tested
libgallium was built with them:

  d4b6701 freedreno: take the highest bank bit from the kernel
  4fa3294 freedreno/a5xx: program the highest bank bit of the part
